# Pinned checksum for the Windows Server 2025 evaluation ISO (issue #14).
# The ISO is fetched by hand through Microsoft's Evaluation Center form (a
# scripted request is refused) and placed at
# $LAB_IMAGE_CACHE/iso/windows-server-2025-eval.iso on the lab host.
#
# NO CHECKSUM IS PINNED YET. scripts/build-windows-image.sh refuses to
# build until a line "<sha256>  windows-server-2025-eval.iso" follows this
# header; the first host run adds it from the ISO it downloaded.
#
# The unattend file selects the image by name, not index:
#   Windows Server 2025 SERVERSTANDARDCORE
# Record here the ISO build it was written for when the line is added.
